# Content-Driven Development Workflow

## Overview

This template generates landing pages from markdown content files in [.content/](mdc:.content/).

## Content File Structure

### Frontmatter (YAML)

```markdown
---
section: hero
variant: centered
theme: gradient
image: /hero.jpg
imagePosition: right
columns: 3
---
```

**Key Frontmatter Fields:**
- `section` → Component type (hero, features, pricing, testimonials, cta)
- `variant` → Component variant (simple, centered, split, grid, list, comparison, slider)
- `theme` → Color theme (light, dark, gradient, blue, purple)
- `image` → Image path
- `imagePosition` → left or right (for split layouts)
- `columns` → Number of columns (2, 3, 4)

### Content Body (Markdown)

```markdown
# Main Headline
Subtitle or description paragraph.

[Button Text](URL) [Another Button](URL)

**Trust indicator or social proof**

---

## Section Title
Section subtitle text.

### Item Title
Item description.

- List item 1
- List item 2
```

