## Content Extraction Patterns

### Hero Section

**Input:**
```markdown
# Build Better Products Faster
Ship features your customers love.
[Get Started](#) [View Demo](#)
**Trusted by 10,000+ teams**
```

**Extract To:**
```typescript
{
  headline: "Build Better Products Faster",
  subtitle: "Ship features your customers love.",
  buttons: [
    { text: "Get Started", href: "#" },
    { text: "View Demo", href: "#", variant: "secondary" }
  ],
  trustIndicator: "Trusted by 10,000+ teams"
}
```

### Features Section

**Input:**
```markdown
## Why Choose Us
Everything you need to succeed.

### Fast Development
Build 10x faster with our platform.

### Secure & Compliant
Enterprise-grade security included.
```

**Extract To:**
```typescript
{
  title: "Why Choose Us",
  subtitle: "Everything you need to succeed.",
  features: [
    { 
      title: "Fast Development", 
      description: "Build 10x faster with our platform." 
    },
    { 
      title: "Secure & Compliant", 
      description: "Enterprise-grade security included." 
    }
  ]
}
```

### Pricing Section

**Input:**
```markdown
## Simple Pricing

### Starter
$0/month
Perfect for individuals.
- Feature 1
- Feature 2
[Get Started](#)

### Pro
$29/month
**MOST POPULAR**
For growing businesses.
- Feature 1
- Feature 2
[Start Trial](#)
```

**Extract To:**
```typescript
{
  title: "Simple Pricing",
  tiers: [
    {
      name: "Starter",
      price: "$0",
      period: "month",
      description: "Perfect for individuals.",
      features: ["Feature 1", "Feature 2"],
      cta: { text: "Get Started", href: "#" }
    },
    {
      name: "Pro",
      price: "$29",
      period: "month",
      description: "For growing businesses.",
      features: ["Feature 1", "Feature 2"],
      cta: { text: "Start Trial", href: "#" },
      highlighted: true,
      badge: "MOST POPULAR"
    }
  ]
}
```

## Generation Workflow

**Step 1:** User provides content file path
```
Generate a landing page from .content/example.md
```

**Step 2:** Read and parse the content file
- Extract frontmatter (YAML between `---`)
- Parse markdown body
- Separate sections (split by `---`)

**Step 3:** For each section:
- Identify section type from frontmatter or heading
- Select appropriate component variant
- Extract content into prop structure
- Reference [shared/types/marketing.types.ts](mdc:shared/types/marketing.types.ts) for types

**Step 4:** Generate page file in `app/[page]/page.tsx`:

```typescript
import type { Metadata } from 'next'
import { HeroCentered, FeaturesGrid, CTASimple } from '@/shared/components/marketing'

export const metadata: Metadata = {
  title: 'Page Title',
  description: 'Page description',
}

export default function Page() {
  return (
    <main>
      <HeroCentered {...heroData} />
      <FeaturesGrid {...featuresData} />
      <CTASimple {...ctaData} />
    </main>
  )
}
```

