## Key Principles

1. **Always read the content file** before generating
2. **Parse frontmatter correctly** for component selection
3. **Extract all content accurately** to props
4. **Use proper TypeScript types** from [shared/types/marketing.types.ts](mdc:shared/types/marketing.types.ts)
5. **Keep route files thin** - only imports and composition
6. **Set metadata** for SEO (title, description)

See [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md) for complete content-driven development guide.
